{"id":"en_this-time-loved-by-mr-right-dubbed","title":"This Time, Loved by Mr. Right(Dubbed)","titleEn":"This Time, Loved by Mr. Right(Dubbed)","description":"After losing everything to Noah, the deceptive son of her driver who passed himself off as nobility, Sophia gets a second chance at life. Reborn with her memories intact, she sets out to recover her family's wealth and sever every connection to the man who ruined her. Her path of revenge, however, takes an unexpected turn when she crosses paths with someone new. The story follows Sophia as she navigates betrayal, payback, and the possibility of genuine love. Those interested in following Sophia's journey can watch the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/566fa1c045d18f4a/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/566fa1c045d18f4a/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identity Twist","Revenge","Identity Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds136/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_this-time-loved-by-mr-right-dubbed_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds136/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-time-loved-by-mr-right-dubbed_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds136/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-time-loved-by-mr-right-dubbed_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds136/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-time-loved-by-mr-right-dubbed_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"